  "body": "Stacked on #999 (#862): this branch is built on `issue/862-refused-program-goldens`, so until #999 merges, the diff against `main` also shows #999's commit. Fork synced at v0.18.0. Effort: high (no escalation).\n\n## What changed\n#862 added the guard `solid_law_goldens::every_posted_golden_is_a_program_the_gate_passes`, which left six posted goldens in `UNJUDGED`. Each one is now run through the gate its kind's post runs, in a new harness `crates/app/tests/posted_gates/mod.rs`. It is a support directory that only `solid_law_goldens` declares, like `area_support/`.\n\n| Golden | Gate | Outcome |\n|---|---|---|\n| `slot_fullwidth_centerline` | `verify`, `Mode::Area`, the stadium `operation::region_of` builds for a real Slot op, no model (`DepthLaw::None`) | clean, dropped from UNJUDGED |\n| `slot_wide_channel_rows` | same | clean, dropped |\n| `trochoid_slot_small` | same, for a TrochoidalSlot op | clean, dropped |\n| `trace_plate_with_hole` | `verify`, `Mode::Engrave`, the plate section `region_of` builds for a Trace op over the finished plate | clean, dropped |\n| `plasma_plate_with_holes` (+ its `_mm` twin, same CL) | the plasma laws, `verify::plasma::judge`, as `posting_plasma::plasma_clause` runs them | no findings at all (no refusals, no warnings), dropped |\n| `arc_planes` | none applies: a hand-built posting fixture (`arc_planes.rs`) with no op kind, part, region or tool record | kept, with that reason; gap filed as #1093 |\n\nEach program is first proved byte-identical to its CL golden. **No golden moved and none was regenerated.** No golden turned out to be an unsafe program the gate would refuse. The guard now checks the blocking findings of all three gate families: depth laws, region laws, and plasma refusals (plasma warnings never block a post). Decisions are in `docs/decisions/1000-judge-unjudged-goldens.md`.\n\n## How tested\nNew pinning tests in `solid_law_goldens`:\n- `the_slot_trace_and_plasma_goldens_pass_their_gates`: all five verdicts are empty.\n- `the_slot_gate_bites`: the wide slot's program, judged against a stadium 2 mm narrower, gouges, so the harness can fail.\n- `every_posted_golden_is_a_program_the_gate_passes`: now judges the five, and `UNJUDGED` holds only `arc_planes`.\n\nI ran these suites locally (debug, the worktree's own target, sccache), all green: solid_law_goldens 5/5, golden_cl 25/25, conformance 6/6, plasma_gate 6/6, plasma_post 5/5, plasma_post_refusals 7/7, plasma_profile 7/7, plasma_machine 6/6, arc_planes 8/8, fanuc_post 11/11, heidenhain_block_form 5/5, trochoid_op 5/5, slot_caps 4/4. `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` is clean.\n\n## Not exercised\n- The full `cargo xtask gate quick` plan. xtask reads any new file under `tests/` as shared test input and plans all ~250 app suites, but only `solid_law_goldens` compiles the new module, so I ran the suites listed above instead.\n- `plasma_plate_with_holes_control.nc` has no `.cl` golden of its own, so the guard doesn't judge it. That is unchanged by this PR.\n\nChangelog: none (test-only)\n\nFixes #1000\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL\n",
